### Correctness

**Must match llama.cpp output exactly for**:
- LLaMA/Llama-2/Llama-3 models (SentencePiece)
- All test cases in `tests/test_comprehensive.rs`
- Unicode handling (emoji, Chinese, etc.)
- Special tokens (BOS/EOS placement)

